  description: A turning wheel of violet omens. What it announces has never once
    been good news.
  tactics: Fires a rotating six-bolt ring (violet, telegraphed) - each volley steps
    a few degrees, so the safe angle NEVER stays. Keep circling in one direction
    and the gaps come to you; freeze and the wheel finds you. Kill it during the
    telegraph pauses.
